hadiths[45]{hadithnumber,text}:
"168","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum mein se jab koi haiz se hoti aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us se milna chahte to Aap use hukm farmate ke wo haiz ke shuru mein tehband bandh le, phir Aap us se milte. Unhon ne kaha: Aur tum mein se kaun apni khwahish par aisa قابو rakhta hai jaisa Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apni khwahish par قابو rakhte they?"
"169","[AI-translation] Hazrat Maimuna (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab apni biwiyon mein se kisi biwi se milna chahte to use hukm farmate, phir wo tehband bandhti jabke wo haiz se hoti."
"170","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath ek ooni chadar mein leti hui thi ke mujhe haiz aa gaya. To main chupke se nikli aur haiz ke kapde liye. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumhe nifas aa gaya? Main ne arz kiya: Haan. Phir Aap ne mujhe bulaya aur main Aap ke sath chadar mein let gayi."
"171","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) janabat se ek bartan se ghusl karte they."
"172","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) masjid mein hote hue mera sar andar kar lete to main use sanwarti, jabke Aap i'tikaf mein hote to ghar mein sirf hajat ke liye dakhil hote."
"173","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mujh se milte jabke main haiz se hoti. Aur Aap masjid se apna sar nikalte jabke Aap i'tikaf mein hote to main use dhoti jabke main haiz se hoti."
"174","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne bayan kiya ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) meri god mein tek lagate jabke main haiz se hoti, phir Quran parhte."
"175","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main mazi kasrat se aane wala shakhs tha. To main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochhne se sharmaya. Phir main ne Miqdad bin al-Aswad ko hukm diya to unhon ne Aap se poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Is mein wuzu hai."
"176","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab sonا chahte jabke Aap junbi hote to apni sharmgah dhote aur namaz ke liye wuzu farmate."
"177","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochha: Kya hum mein se koi so sakta hai jabke wo junbi ho? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, jab tum mein se koi wuzu kare to use chahiye ke soye jabke wo junbi ho."
"178","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zikr kiya ke unhe raat mein janabat lahق hoti hai. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Wuzu karo, apne satr ko dho aur phir so jao."
"179","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabiullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ek raat mein apni biwiyon ke paas phirte, jabke us din Aap ki nau biwiyan thein."
"180","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umm Sulaim Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayein aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Allah haq se nahi sharmata. To kya aurat par ghusl hai jab use ehtelam ho? To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab wo pani dekhe. Phir Umm Salama ne apna chehra dhank liya, matlab unhon ne apna chehra chhupaya, aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya aurat ko ehtelam hota hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, tumhara dayan hath khaak-aalood ho. Phir us ka bachcha us se mushabeh kyun hota hai?"
"181","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab janabat se ghusl farmate to ibtida mein apne dono hath dhote, phir namaz ke wuzu jaisa wuzu farmate. Phir apni ungliyan pani mein dakhil karte aur un se apne baalon ki jadon ka khilal farmate. Phir apne sar par apne dono hathon se teen lap dalte, phir apne pure jism par pani bahate."
"182","[AI-translation] Hazrat Maimuna (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye ghusl ka pani dala. To Aap ne apne dayan se apne bayan par pani dala aur unhe dhoya. Phir Aap ne apni sharmgah dhoyi. Phir Aap ne apne hath se zameen ko lagaya aur use mitti se mala, phir use dhoya. Phir kulli ki aur naak mein pani dala, phir apna chehra dhoya aur apne sar par pani bahaya. Phir hate aur apne dono paon dhoye. Phir Aap ke paas rumal laya gaya to Aap ne us se pani na jhaada."
"183","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab janabat se ghusl farmate to doodh ke bartan jaisi koi cheez mangwate. Phir apni hatheli se pakadte aur apne sar ke dayan hisse se ibtida farmate, phir bayan se. Phir un dono se apne sar par dalte."
"184","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ek bartan se ghusl karte they, ek pyale se jise Faraq kaha jata hai."
"185","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se un ke bhai ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ghusl ke bare mein poochha. To unhon ne ek sa' ke qareeb bartan mangwaya. Phir ghusl kiya aur apne sar par pani bahaya, jabke hamare aur un ke darmiyan parda tha [Abu Salama ka qaul hai]."
"186","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ek sa' se paanch mudd tak se ghusl farmate, ya ghusl karte they, aur ek mudd se wuzu farmate."
"187","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jubair bin Mut'im (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Raha main, main apne sar par teen martaba pani bahata hun. Aur Aap ne apne dono hathon se ishara farmaya, dono se."
"188","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, Abu Ja'far ne kaha: Wo un ke paas they, wo aur un ke walid, aur un ke paas ek jamaat thi. To unhon ne un se ghusl ke bare mein poochha. To unhon ne farmaya: Tumhe ek sa' kafi hai. To ek shakhs ne kaha: Mujhe kafi nahi hota. To Jabir ne kaha: Jo tum se zyada baalon wala aur tum se behtar tha use kafi hota tha. Phir unhon ne hamein ek kapde mein imamat karayi."
"189","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke ek aurat ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se haiz se ghusl ke bare mein poochha. To Aap ne use hukm farmaya ke wo kaise ghusl kare. Aap ne farmaya: Mushk lagi rui ka tukda lo aur us se taharat hasil karo. Us ne arz kiya: Main us se kaise taharat hasil karun? Aap ne farmaya: Us se taharat hasil karo. Us ne arz kiya: Kaise? Aap ne farmaya: SubhanAllah! Us se taharat hasil karo. Phir main use apni taraf kheench liya aur kaha: Khoon ke nishan par us se peechha karo."
"190","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Fatima bint Abi Hubaish Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayein aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main istihaza wali aurat hun aur paak nahi hoti. To kya main namaz chhor dun? To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Nahi, ye to ek rag hai aur haiz nahi hai. Phir jab tumhara haiz aaye to namaz chhor do, aur jab wo peeth pher jaye to apne aap se khoon dho aur phir namaz parho. Phir har namaz ke liye wuzu karo yahan tak ke wo waqt aa jaye."
"191","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Umm Habiba ko saat saal istihaza raha. To unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se is ke bare mein poochha. To Aap ne unhe ghusl ka hukm diya aur farmaya: Ye ek rag hai. Phir wo har namaz ke liye ghusl karti thein."
"192","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke ek aurat ne un se kaha: Kya hum mein se ek jab paak ho to apni namaz ki qaza kare? To unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum Haruriya ho? Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath haiz se hoti thein to Wo hamein is ka hukm na farmate. Ya unhon ne kaha: To hum aisa na karte."
"193","[AI-translation] Abu Talib ki beti Hazrat Umm Hani (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Fatah ke saal Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas gayi to Aap ko ghusl karte paya, jabke Aap ki beti Fatima Aap ka parda kar rahi thein. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne Aap ko salam kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye kaun hai? Main ne arz kiya: Main Umm Hani bint Abi Talib hun. To Aap ne farmaya: Umm Hani ko khush-aamdeed. Phir jab Aap apne ghusl se farigh hue to khade hue aur aath rakatein parhein, ek kapde mein lipti hui. Phir jab Aap phire to main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Meri maan ke bete ne dawa kiya hai ke wo ek shakhs ko qatl karega jise main ne panah di hai, falan bin Hubaira. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Hum ne use panah di jise tum ne panah di, ae Umm Hani! Umm Hani ne kaha: Aur ye chasht ka waqt tha."
"194","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Bani Israil nange ghusl karte they, ek doosre ko dekhta tha. Aur Musa akele ghusl karte they. To unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Musa ko hamare sath ghusl karne se sirf ye rokta hai ke wo bad-wasa hain. Phir ek martaba wo ghusl karne gaye aur apna kapda pathar par rakha. To pathar un ke kapde ko lekar bhag gaya. Phir Musa us ke peechhe nikle kehte hue: Mera kapda, ae pathar! Yahan tak ke Bani Israil ne Musa ko dekha. To unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Musa mein koi aib nahi. Aur unhon ne apna kapda liya aur pathar ko marne lage. Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak pathar par chhe ya saat maar se nishan hain, pathar par maar se."
"195","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Kaaba ke liye un ke sath pathar uthate they jabke Aap par Aap ka tehband tha. To Aap ke chacha Abbas ne Aap se kaha: Ae bhatije! Kash tum apna tehband khol do aur use patharon ke neeche apne kandhon par rakh lo. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne use khola aur use apne kandhon par rakha. To Aap behosh ho kar gir gaye. Phir is ke baad Aap kabhi nange nahi dekhe gaye (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)."
"196","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ansar mein se ek shakhs ko bulaya. To wo aaya jabke us ka sar tapak raha tha. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Shayad hum ne tumhe jaldi mein dala. To us ne arz kiya: Haan. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tumhe jaldi ho ya mani na nikle to tum par wuzu hai."
"197","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubayy bin Ka'b (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Jab mard aurat se jima kare aur mani na nikle? Aap ne farmaya: Jo aurat ko laga usے dhoye, phir wuzu kare aur namaz parhe."
"198","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usman bin Affan (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un se Zaid bin Khalid ne kaha: Batayiye, jab wo jima kare aur mani na nikle? To Usman ne farmaya: Wo wuzu kare jaisa namaz ke liye wuzu karta hai aur apne satr ko dhoye. Usman ne kaha: Main ne ye Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai."
"199","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab wo us ki chaar shakhon ke darmiyan baithe phir us se koshish kare to ghusl wajib ho gaya."
"200","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne bakri ka shana khaya phir namaz parhi aur wuzu na farmaya."
"201","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Umayyah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko bakri ke shane se kaatte dekha. Phir Aap ko namaz ke liye bulaya gaya to Aap ne chhuri phenk di. Phir namaz parhi aur wuzu na farmaya."
"202","[AI-translation] Hazrat Maimuna (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ke paas shana khaya, phir namaz parhi aur wuzu na farmaya."
"203","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne doodh piya phir kulli ki aur farmaya: Beshak is mein chiknayi hai."
"204","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Zaid bin Asim al-Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se us shakhs ki shikayat ki jise khayal hota hai ke wo namaz mein koi cheez pata hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo na phire ya na laute yahan tak ke awaz sune ya boo paye."
"205","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek mari hui bakri payi jo Maimuna ki aazad-karda londi ko sadqe se di gayi thi. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne us ki khaal se faida kyun na uthaya? Unhon ne arz kiya: Wo murdar hai. Aap ne farmaya: Us ka khana hi haram hua hai."
"206","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Aap ke ek safar mein nikle. Yahan tak ke jab hum Baida mein they, ya Dhat al-Jaish mein, mera ek haar toot gaya. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ki talash mein thehre aur log Aap ke sath thehre, jabke wo pani par na they. Phir log Abu Bakr Siddiq ke paas aaye aur arz kiya: Kya tum nahi dekhte Aisha ne kya kiya? Us ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur logon ko rok diya jabke wo pani par nahi hain aur un ke paas pani nahi hai. Phir Abu Bakr aaye jabke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apna sar meri raan par rakha tha aur so gaye they. To unhon ne farmaya: Tum ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur logon ko rok diya jabke wo pani par nahi hain aur un ke paas pani nahi hai. To Aisha ne kaha: Phir Abu Bakr ne mujhe danta aur jo Allah ne chaha kaha, aur apne hath se meri kokh mein chubhone lage. Phir mujhe harkat karne se sirf Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka meri raan par hona rokta tha. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) subah baghair pani ke uthe. To Allah ne tayammum ki ayat nazil farmayi. Phir unhon ne tayammum kiya. To Usaid bin al-Hudair ne kaha: Ye tumhari pehli barkat nahi, ae Abu Bakr ke ghar walo! Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum ne us oont ko uthaya jis par main thi aur haar us ke neeche paya."
"207","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ammar se Shaqiq ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abdullah aur Abu Musa al-Ash'ari ke sath baitha tha. To Abu Musa ne un se kaha: Agar ek shakhs junbi ho aur use ek mahina pani na mile, to kya wo tayammum karega aur namaz parhega? Tum is ayat ke sath kya karte ho jo Surah al-Maida mein hai [phir tum pani na pao to paak mitti se tayammum karo]? To Abdullah ne kaha: Agar unhe is mein rukhsat di jaye to anqareeb jab un par pani thanda lagega to wo mitti se tayammum karenge. Main ne kaha: Tum ne ise isi liye na-pasand kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Phir Abu Musa ne kaha: Kya tum ne Ammar ka Umar se qaul nahi suna: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe ek hajat mein bheja. Phir main junbi ho gaya aur mujhe pani na mila. To main mitti mein lota jaise janwar lot-ta hai. Phir main ne is ka Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zikr kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Tumhe yahi karna kafi tha. Phir Aap ne apni hatheli se zameen par ek zarb lagayi, phir use jhaada, phir us se apne dayan hath ki pusht ka apne bayan se, ya apne bayan ki pusht ka apni hatheli se masah kiya, phir us se apne chehre ka masah kiya. Phir Abdullah ne kaha: Kya tum ne nahi dekha ke Umar Ammar ke qaul se mutma'in na hue?"
"208","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ammar (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs Umar bin al-Khattab ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Main junbi ho gaya aur mujhe pani na mila. To Ammar bin Yasir ne Umar bin al-Khattab se kaha: Kya tumhe yaad nahi ke hum safar mein they, main aur tum? Raha tum, tum ne namaz na parhi, aur raha main, main mitti mein lota aur namaz parhi. Phir main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zikr kiya. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tumhe yahi kafi tha. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni dono hatheliyan zameen par marein aur un mein phoonka, phir un dono se apne chehre aur apni hatheliyon ka masah kiya."
"209","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu al-Juhaim al-Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se Umair maula Ibn Abbas ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main aur Abdullah bin Yasar maula Maimuna zauja Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aaye yahan tak ke hum Abu Juhaim bin al-Harith bin al-Simma al-Ansari ke paas dakhil hue. To Abu al-Juhaim ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Bi'r Jamal ki taraf se aaye. To Aap ko ek shakhs mila aur us ne salam kiya. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use jawab na diya yahan tak ke Aap deewar ki taraf aaye. Phir Aap ne apne chehre aur apne hathon ka masah kiya, phir use salam ka jawab diya."
"210","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mile jabke main junbi tha. To Aap ne mera hath pakda. Phir main Aap ke sath chala yahan tak ke Aap baithe. Phir main Aap se chupke se nikla aur rehal ke paas aaya aur ghusl kiya. Phir main aaya jabke Wo baithe they. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu Hirr! Tum kahan they? To main ne Aap se arz kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: SubhanAllah! Ae Abu Hirr! Beshak momin napak nahi hota."
"211","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab bait al-khala mein dakhil hote to farmate: Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah mangta hun khabees jinon aur khabees jinnion se."
"212","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Namaz khadi ki gayi jabke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) masjid ke kinare ek shakhs se sargoshi kar rahe they. Phir Aap namaz ke liye khade na hue yahan tak ke log so gaye."
